Z||000009||firstfiero||07-15-2001||10:24 PM||||    No...What is sad is your sense of humor....or lack their of.<P>------------------<BR>Hey Mr. Ricer come over here and tell me how your stickers make you faster.....<BR>          <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/headshot.gif">          <BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/firstfiero.gif"> ||||reg||1
Z||000010||Simple Fiero||07-16-2001||12:36 AM||||  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by firstfiero:<BR><B>    No...What is sad is your sense of humor....or lack their of.<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>What because I am not a racist, come on. Calling someone a ricer is racist, and if you don't think so next time you see someone of asia decent driving their honda, or acura, yell ricer at them and think about what you just did, how you just made that person feel. All I was trying to do was make you guys open up your eyes and see what you are doing. We all love cars in the end, you think that it could be peaceful, but OH NO. I am by no means perfect, but next time you are out in your fiero crusin be the bigger man if you wanna race then race, but you don't have to hurl insults as well, and if they do at you then let it go and just be bigger about it. We all know that we have a great car but we don't have to be a-holes about it. I would love to have a WRX Subaru, or a civic si all lowered and pimped out, but I also don't have 25,000 big ones or more. So I got a car that looked aggressive and would fit my means, and that just happened to be the fiero. There is another thread going where everyone is bitching cause they are sick of there fieros being insulted, hmm funny how when it is directed at us we turn into a bunch of bitching babies. But when we turn it on others it is funny as hell. Life is strange eh!!!!<p>[This message has been edited by Simple Fiero (edited 07-16-2001).]||||reg||1
