Z||000016||Simple Fiero||07-16-2001||08:43 PM||||[QUOTE]Originally posted by Galen:<BR>[B]Simple Fiero, I direct you to that quote the old wiseman told me.. "He who believes what he is told before he fully understands talks too much"<P>Okay maybe I jumped to fast all I was trying to do was give you guys a warning, that before you call someone a ricer just watch who you say it too. Someday u may say it to the wrong person, and truely hurt that person, (sorry if I am getting to hippiness).<BR>I jump the gun a little, it's just that I am sick of this ricer garbage. So what if they are into looks, and your into speed, sorry if I look at a beautiful civic, before I look at a plain black fiero gt doing 140, maybe it's just the way my mind works. So if I offended anyone,I apoligize(can't help it it's the canadian in me) and yes I realize that most are crackers like me, so for all the crackers out there I say yo.<BR>And Galen I will bookmark that page, and throw out my dictionary.(J/KING)||||reg||1
